                                        "entry_id": "9e193851-f930-3237-b918-477c54b7748c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The former name, from 330–1930 C.E., of Istanbul, the largest city in Turkey; the former capital of the Ottoman Empire and of the Byzantine Empire before that."
